{
  "version": 2,
  "size": "a4",
  "margin": { "top": 40, "right": 20, "bottom": 30, "left": 20 },
  "applyBorder": true,
  "border": 1,
  "fFamily": "Times-Roman",
  "newDoc": true,
  "filePath": "",
  "_notes": [
    "Section-based conversion of the legacy hardcoded Default2 design (buildPage.default.js createHeader2/createBody2/createFooter2) — the legacy box lines and partition lines are restored: the biller band box, the invoice-meta box with its vertical centre line, the customer box with its vertical centre line, the footer's declaration box, the signature box with its one-third horizontal line, and the tax-summary box with its header line. The table band lines come from the TableBlock drawGrid.",
    "Approximations vs the legacy fixed coordinates: zone heights are designer-editable (all sections auto-size; the table pages at the page bottom); GSTIN and the caption are a 2-cell row inside the biller box (legacy shares one line); the meta box drops the legacy G.R.Date cell (no variable) and pairs 3 rows instead of 3+4; the tax summary drops the TAX RATE% column (rate comes from saleConfig, not billMeta) and uses 4 columns; the dashed bank-details line and the GST-rate column of the items table are dropped; the declaration wording is generic.",
    "Renderer collapses blocks whose value is empty, so optional fields (e-mail, transport, e-way, scrap TDS, CR/DR) leave no gap."
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "d2-header",
      "type": "header",
      "name": "Header",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 0,
      "columns": 1,
      "padding": 8,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d2-biller-box",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Biller",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 1,
          "padding": 4,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": true,
          "partitions": [],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d2-biller-topline",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "GSTIN & Copy",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 2,
              "padding": 0,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": false,
              "partitions": [],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "d2-gstin",
                  "type": "variable",
                  "variable": "biller-gst",
                  "prefix": "GSTIN: ",
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2-copy",
                  "type": "variable",
                  "variable": "bill-copy",
                  "align": "right",
                  "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-title",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "GST INVOICE",
              "align": "center",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 20, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": true, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-shreehari",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "|| SHREE HARI ||",
              "align": "center",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 14, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 6, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-biller-name",
              "type": "variable",
              "variable": "biller-name",
              "prefix": "M/s. ",
              "align": "center",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 14, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" }
            },
            { "id": "d2-biller-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-address", "align": "center" },
            { "id": "d2-biller-ph", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-phone", "prefix": "Contact : ", "align": "center" },
            { "id": "d2-biller-email", "type": "variable", "variable": "biller-email", "prefix": "E-mail : ", "align": "center", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 10, "left": 0 } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-meta-box",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Invoice Meta",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 2,
          "padding": 4,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": true,
          "partitions": [ { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
          "blocks": [
            { "id": "d2-inv-no", "type": "variable", "variable": "bill-no-formatted", "prefix": "Invoice No.: ", "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d2-transport", "type": "variable", "variable": "transportName", "prefix": "Transport: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d2-date", "type": "variable", "variable": "date", "prefix": "Invoice Date: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d2-grno", "type": "variable", "variable": "orderRef", "prefix": "G.R.No.: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d2-pos", "type": "variable", "variable": "placeOfSupply", "prefix": "Place of supply: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 } },
            { "id": "d2-eway", "type": "variable", "variable": "ewayBill", "prefix": "Eway bill no: ", "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 10, "left": 0 } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-customer-box",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Customer",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 2,
          "padding": 4,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": true,
          "partitions": [ { "direction": "col", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d2-billedto-label",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Billed to:",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 }
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-shippedto-label",
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shipped to:",
              "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
              "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 }
            },
            { "id": "d2-cust-name", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-name" },
            { "id": "d2-ship-to", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipTo" },
            { "id": "d2-cust-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-address" },
            { "id": "d2-ship-addr", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipAddr" },
            { "id": "d2-cust-state", "type": "variable", "variable": "stateNcode", "prefix": "Code & State: " },
            { "id": "d2-ship-state", "type": "variable", "variable": "stateNcode", "prefix": "Code & State: " },
            { "id": "d2-cust-gst", "type": "variable", "variable": "customer-gst", "prefix": "GSTIN: " },
            { "id": "d2-ship-gst", "type": "variable", "variable": "shipGST", "prefix": "GSTIN: " }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-body",
      "type": "body",
      "name": "Body",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 0,
      "columns": 1,
      "padding": 0,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d2-table",
          "type": "table",
          "thHeight": 24,
          "fSize": 12,
          "rSpacing": 4,
          "cellPadding": 4,
          "drawGrid": true,
          "margin": { "top": 12, "right": 0, "bottom": 12, "left": 0 },
          "cols": [
            { "label": "S.N.", "variable": "slno", "width": 6 },
            { "label": "Product Description", "variable": "name", "width": 30 },
            { "label": "HSN/SA C", "variable": "hsn", "width": 10 },
            { "label": "QUANTITY", "variable": "qty", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "UNIT", "variable": "unit", "width": 8 },
            { "label": "PRICE/UNIT", "variable": "rate", "width": 10 },
            { "label": "AMOUNT", "variable": "total", "width": 28 }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-footer",
      "type": "footer",
      "name": "Footer",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "cornerRadius": 10,
      "height": 0,
      "columns": 1,
      "padding": 8,
      "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
      "applyBorder": false,
      "partitions": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d2-jurisdiction",
          "type": "variable",
          "variable": "place-of-jurisdiction",
          "align": "center",
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-bank",
          "type": "variable",
          "variable": "biller-bank",
          "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-words",
          "type": "variable",
          "variable": "gtotal-words",
          "prefix": "Rs. ",
          "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 12, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
          "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-declaration-row",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Declaration & Signature",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 2,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d2-declaration-box",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "Declaration",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 1,
              "padding": 4,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": true,
              "partitions": [],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "d2-declaration",
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Declaration: We declare that this invoice shows the actual price of the goods described and that all particulars are true and correct.",
                  "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-signature-box",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "Signature",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 1,
              "padding": 4,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": true,
              "partitions": [ { "direction": "row", "range": 33, "lWidth": 1 } ],
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "d2-pan",
                  "type": "variable",
                  "variable": "pan",
                  "prefix": "Company's PAN: ",
                  "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 4, "left": 0 }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2-eoe",
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "E. & O.E",
                  "align": "center",
                  "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": false, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" },
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2-sign-for",
                  "type": "variable",
                  "variable": "biller-name",
                  "prefix": "For M/s ",
                  "align": "right",
                  "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 2, "left": 0 }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2-seal",
                  "type": "image",
                  "source": "seal",
                  "imgWidth": 12,
                  "imgHeight": 12,
                  "imgOpacity": 100,
                  "applyAspectRatio": true,
                  "aspectRatio": "1:1",
                  "align": "right",
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 8, "left": 0 }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2-sign-label",
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Authorised Signatory",
                  "align": "right",
                  "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 12, "left": 0 }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d2-summary-row",
          "type": "section",
          "name": "Tax Summary & Totals",
          "shape": "rectangle",
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "height": 0,
          "columns": 2,
          "padding": 0,
          "margin": { "top": 8, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
          "applyBorder": false,
          "partitions": [],
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "d2-summary-box",
              "type": "section",
              "name": "Tax Summary",
              "shape": "rectangle",
              "cornerRadius": 10,
              "height": 0,
              "columns": 4,
              "padding": 4,
              "margin": { "top": 0, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "applyBorder": true,
              "partitions": [ { "direction": "row", "range": 50, "lWidth": 1 } ],
              "blocks": [
                { "id": "d2-sum-taxable-l", "type": "text", "content": "TAXABLE VALUE", "align": "center", "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" } },
                { "id": "d2-sum-sgst-l", "type": "text", "content": "SGST", "align": "center", "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" } },
                { "id": "d2-sum-cgst-l", "type": "text", "content": "CGST", "align": "center", "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" } },
                { "id": "d2-sum-total-l", "type": "text", "content": "TOTAL GST", "align": "center", "font": { "family": "Times-Roman", "size": 10, "bold": true, "italic": false, "underline": false, "color": "#000000" } },
                { "id": "d2-sum-taxable-v", "type": "variable", "variable": "netAmt", "align": "center" },
                { "id": "d2-sum-sgst-v", "type": "variable", "variable": "net-SGST", "align": "center" },
                { "id": "d2-sum-cgst-v", "type": "variable", "variable": "net-CGST", "align": "center" },
                { "id": "d2-sum-total-v", "type": "variable", "variable": "netTax", "align": "center" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-totals",
              "type": "totals",
              "margin": { "top": 4, "right": 0, "bottom": 0, "left": 0 },
              "rows": [
                { "label": "SUB TOTAL", "variable": "sub-total", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "LESS DISCOUNT", "variable": "discVal", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "TOTAL", "variable": "netAmt", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "ADD GST", "variable": "netTax", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "SCRAP TDS", "variable": "scrap-tds", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "CR/DR", "variable": "payment", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "ROUND OFF", "variable": "ro", "align": "right" },
                { "label": "GRAND TOTAL", "variable": "grand-total", "align": "right" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
